# Python Style

- `ruff` only (format + lint); line length **100**
- Run tools via `uv` (`uv sync`, `uv run …`)

## Local checks (before push / PR)

```bash
uv run ruff check . && uv run ruff format --check .
uv run pytest
```

Auto-fix: `uv run ruff check --fix . && uv run ruff format .`

- Coverage gate: ≥60% line coverage
- Behavior changes → update `.hatchery/docs/`, `README.md`, or `CONTRIBUTING.md`

```
✅ Add/change a function and its test in the same change
❌ "I'll add tests in a follow-up"
❌ Push/PR that fails ruff or pytest
❌ Rely on CI instead of running the commands above
```
